**The Bug:**
The design uses `display: flex; gap: 1rem;` which works in Chrome/Firefox but not in Safari 14.

**The Fix:**
```css
.container {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem; /* Modern browsers */
}

@supports not (gap: 1rem) {
  .container {
    margin: -0.5rem;
  }
  .container > * {
    margin: 0.5rem;
  }
}
```

**Testing Required:**
1. Verify gap works in Chrome/Firefox/Edge
2. Verify fallback works in Safari < 15
3. Test both desktop and mobile Safari

