content.details:
**Bug:** Users report submit button doesn't work on iPhones.

**Investigation:**
1. Desktop Chrome: Works fine
2. iPhone Safari: First tap highlights button (hover state), second tap submits
3. **Root Cause:** Button has `:hover { background: darkBlue; }` that persists on mobile after first tap

**Fix:**
```css
@media (hover: hover) {
  /* Hover effects only for devices that support hover */
  button:hover {
    background: darkBlue;
  }
}
/* Or use touch-action CSS */
button {
  touch-action: manipulation;
}
```

**Test:** Verify single-tap works on all mobile devices.

